===persian===

پدرم...
دو سکوت داشت، یک فریاد...
دو لبخند...
یکی غمگین...
یکی شاد...
غم را به دیاری دور...
به خواهرانم فرستاد...
برایش آواز خواندم...
غمِ عشق را به من داد...
۱۳۷۲/۳/۱۶

===machine===

My father...
had two silences, one cry...
two smiles...
one of them sorrowful...
one glad...
The sorrow he sent away to a far country...
to my sisters...
I sang for him...
and he gave me the sorrow of love...
1372/3/16

===lantern===

My father
had two silences and one cry,
two smiles —
one of them sorrowful,
one glad.
The sorrow he sent to a far country,
to my sisters.
I sang for him,
and he gave me the sorrow of love.

1372/3/16

